Position: QA Engineer

Experience: - 1+ years of working experience in manual black-box testing, test case design and execution, bug tracking and reporting, developing/maintaining checklists, functional and non-functional testing, regression testing, usability;
- Knowledge of QA methodologies;
- SQL;
- Experience in working with bug-tracking systems; 
- REST API testing;
- Self-motivator, quick learner, strong attentive to details and punctuality, hard-working and result oriented, communicative and proactive;
- Ability to work within tight deadlines;
- Team player but also able to work independently.

Highlights: implementation of one of the testing projects (project for accounting).

